      "comment": "LITTLE KADE (7) was below best at her last couple, the latest finishing eighth at this track, but was among the placings at Bulli three back. Likely to improve sharply this time. DAM BACCI (2) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 401m behind Broadway Baby (24.10) in a Grade 5. Should be about the money. MISS BANSKY (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (23.37) in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. The form out of her last race has been franked. Worth following up. FAST FOOTWORK (1) is another with top-three prospects.",
